    "title": "How to Watch the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards for Free - Los Angeles Today",
    "text": "Mar. 26, 2026 at 12:35am Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›The 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards are set to take place on Thursday, March 26th at the Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles. The ceremony will be hosted by rapper Ludacris and feature performances from artists like Alex Warren, Kehlani, and RAYE. Cosmopolitan favorites Sombr, Shaboozey, Alysa Liu, and iHeartRadio Innovator Award recipient Miley Cyrus will also make appearances, and Taylor Swift is expected to return to the show for its 13th year. Fans can watch the awards live on FOX or stream it through various platforms like FOXOne, Hulu + Live TV, YouTubeTV, DirecTV Stream, and FuboTV. Why it matters The iHeartRadio Music Awards are a major annual event in the music industry, recognizing the top artists, songs, and albums of the year. The show's return to the Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles after the pandemic disruptions of the past few years is a sign of the industry's recovery, and the appearance of high-profile artists like Taylor Swift and Miley Cyrus will generate significant interest and viewership. The details The 13th annual iHeartRadio Music Awards will air live on FOX on Thursday, March 26th from 8-10 p.m. ET. The ceremony can also be heard on iHeartRadio stations nationwide and streamed on the iHeartRadio app. Fans have several options to watch the awards show for free, including through FOXOne's 7-day free trial, Hulu + Live TV's 3-day free trial, YouTubeTV's 21-day free trial, DirecTV Stream's 5-day free trial, and FuboTV's 7-day free trial. The 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards will take place on Thursday, March 26, 2026 from 8-10 p.m. ET. The players LudacrisA rap superstar who will be hosting the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards ceremony.Alex WarrenA musician who is scheduled to perform at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.KehlaniA musician who is scheduled to perform at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.RAYEA musician who is scheduled to perform at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.SombrA Cosmopolitan-favorite musician who will make an appearance at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.ShaboozeyA Cosmopolitan-favorite musician who will make an appearance at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.Alysa LiuA Cosmopolitan-favorite musician who will make an appearance at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.Miley CyrusThe recipient of the iHeartRadio Innovator Award who will make an appearance at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards.Taylor SwiftA major music star who is expected to return to the iHeartRadio Music Awards for its 13th year. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › The takeaway The 2026 iHeartRadio Music Awards promise to be a star-studded event, featuring performances and appearances from some of the biggest names in music. Fans have multiple options to stream the ceremony live for free, making it accessible to a wide audience and ensuring the continued popularity and relevance of this annual awards show.",
